      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">microporous films of the present invention</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">may also have an average pore size of 100 to 5,000 Angstroms, and more usually to 3,000 Angstroms, the values being determined by mercury porosimetry, as described in an or by R. G. Quynn, on pages 21-34 of Textile Research Journal, January, 1963.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="">
