      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">advantages of the present invention</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">can be illustrated by comparison of identical elastic film stretched 100 percent hot (extension ratio of 1.0:1) or 100 percent cold (extension ratio of 0.1) with one where as little as 5 percent cold stretch (extension ratio of0.95:1) prior to the hot stretch gives excellent porosity and stability.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="">
