      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the film</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is cold stretched at 25C. to 10 percent of EXAMPLE XXI Crystalline polyethylene having a density of 0.96 and a melt index of 0.7 is melt extruded at 195C. through V a 4 inch diameter annular die having an opening of 0.04 inches.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
