      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the extrudate</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is drawn down to a drawdown ratio of 100:1 and passed through a series of rollers which collapses the tube. After wind-up the film is oven annealed in a tensionless state at 1 15C. for 16 hours.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="">
