      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the film</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">After removal from the oven, the film is allowed to cool, and stretched at an extension ratio of 0.80, by 50 percent of its original length with cold stretching being conducted at 25C. and hot stretching being conducted at 1 15C., and heat set in the oven at constant length for 5 minutes at 120C, after which it is found to have the open-celled microporous structure of the present invention.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="">
