        <span itemprop="definition">cold stretching a non-porous, crystalline, elastic film until porous surface regions perpendicular to the stretch direction are formed, the non-porous elastic film having crystallinity of above about 20 percent, and an elastic recovery from a 50 percent strain of at least 40 percent at 25C.</span>
